resman (1.30.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Separate CPU, RAM and I/O eligibility, enforcement and observation contracts.
  * Reconcile active process membership and base IOPS decisions on block operations.
  * Require stateless MCP revision 2026-07-28 over HTTPS with TLS 1.3 by default.
  * Harden configuration, SQLite, logging and runtime filesystem persistence.
  * Add typed cross-package contracts, deterministic lifecycle handling and truthful
    operational metrics and errors.
  * Add shared CI contract checks and disposable functional regression gates.

